## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design autonomous, tenant-aware resilience in a distributed telemetry pipeline, emphasizing observability, per-tenant governance, and cross-region failure handling.

## Key Concepts

- OpenTelemetry integration across Kinesis → Lambda/Fargate → S3 → Glue/Athena
- Per-tenant SLAs guiding auto remediation and failover
- Exactly-once semantics with idempotent writes and deduplication
- Self-healing, circuit breakers, and backpressure to prevent cascading outages

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal idempotent writer for deduplication
async function writeEvent(event, store){
  const id = event.dedupToken;
  if (await store.exists(id)) return;
  await store.put(id, event.payload);
}
```

